//
//  SPKTranslations.m
//  Sparkle
//
//  GENERATED FILE - do not edit by hand.
//
//  Simplified Chinese table embedded directly in the tweak binary.
//  Keeping the translations inside the dylib (rather than only in
//  Sparkle.bundle) is what allows Sparkle to be injected as a bare
//  dynamic library - e.g. with TrollFools - with no resource bundle
//  installed on disk. An external bundle, when present, still wins so
//  translations can be refreshed without a rebuild.
//

